WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:19.683
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.683 --> 00:00:26.985
Tap Instructor, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:30.173
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.173 --> 00:00:34.394
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.394 --> 00:00:40.394
Type your six digits.

6
00:00:40.394 --> 00:00:45.755
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.755 --> 00:00:51.340
This is the Instructor Panel. Five tabs across the top.

8
00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:56.188
Every row has three buttons on the right.

9
00:00:56.188 --> 00:01:02.892
Find the attendee and tap Profile.

10
00:01:02.892 --> 00:01:08.513
Name, phone, grade and student number all live here.

11
00:01:08.513 --> 00:01:12.558
Clear the old phone number.

12
00:01:12.558 --> 00:01:18.547
Type the new one.

13
00:01:18.547 --> 00:01:23.758
Tap Save.

14
00:01:23.758 --> 00:01:32.433
The attendance history is untouched — it follows the person, not the name.
